<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{true}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">EXPORT / 留在自己手中</view><view class="title">导出这一次的报告</view><view wx:if="{{report}}" class="note">报告采集于 {{report.collected}}<view></view>{{report.longCount}} 首长期 / {{report.heartCount}} 首选定红心</view><view class="card"><button class="list-button" bindtap="format" data-id="json">{{format==='json'?'●':'○'}} 完整 JSON · 卡片与来源</button><button class="list-button" bindtap="format" data-id="input1">{{format==='input1'?'●':'○'}} 输入1 CSV · 长期歌曲特征</button><button class="list-button" bindtap="format" data-id="input2">{{format==='input2'?'●':'○'}} 输入2 CSV · 选定红心特征</button></view><view class="caption">文件含个人音乐偏好，保存与发送前请确认。不含账号ID、Cookie或登录token；独立副本不随账户删除自动消失。</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !report}}">确认并保存到小程序</button><block wx:if="{{filePath}}"><view class="note">文件已准备好，可通过微信选择发送或另存。<view class="caption">{{filename}}</view></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="shareFile">选择发送文件</button><button class="link" bindtap="deleteLocal">删除本地导出文件</button></block></view></view></view>
